<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Columbia/HCA started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Geoffrey Harris has started coverage of Columbia/HCA Healthcare Corp with a rating of buy, a source at the brokerage said Friday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Nashville, Tenn., company closed Thursday at 35-3/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
